{"schema_version":2,"diagram_type":"workflow","meta":{"title":"Hydro-Agent 水文预报方案构建与优化流程","locale":"zh-CN","animation":"trace","visual_preset":"signal-flow","quality_profile":"showcase","views":[{"id":"main-flow","label":"完整业务流程","focus":["task","check_data","prepare_scheme","forecast","check_output","diagnose","freeze","replay","evaluate","report"],"note":"先看主线：准备任务 → 检查资料 → 运行模型 → 分析问题 → 处理并验证 → 冻结 → 回放 → 评价。"},{"id":"decision-loop","label":"智能诊断与处理闭环","focus":["check_output","diagnose","repair","rebuild","adapt","compare","forecast"],"note":"当结果存在问题时，智能体判断原因，选择修数据、重建状态或有限调优，并重新验证。"}]},"lanes":[{"id":"user","label":"研究者 / 最终输出"},{"id":"agent","label":"智能体：分析问题、选择下一步"},{"id":"tools","label":"专业工具：检查、处理、评价"},{"id":"model","label":"水文模型 / 优化器：数值计算"}],"phases":[{"id":"build","label":"B：构建与历史适配（允许诊断和有限调优）","fromCol":0,"toCol":4,"variant":"emphasis"},{"id":"frozen","label":"F / E：冻结回放与最终评价","fromCol":5,"toCol":5,"variant":"dashed"}],"groups":[{"id":"agent_loop","label":"核心闭环：发现问题 → 判断原因 → 选择动作 → 再验证","lane":"agent","fromCol":3,"toCol":4,"variant":"emphasis"}],"mainPath":["task","check_data","prepare_scheme","forecast","check_output","diagnose","freeze","replay","evaluate","report"],"nodes":[{"id":"task","lane":"user","col":0,"type":"external","label":"1. 配置一个预报任务","sublabel":"选择流域、日期范围、数据源和水文模型","tag":"一次性配置","width":178},{"id":"check_data","lane":"tools","col":1,"type":"database","label":"2. 检查数据能不能用于预报","sublabel":"缺测？单位和时间对不对？资料是否齐全？","tag":"A01–A02","width":190,"yOffset":-40},{"id":"prepare_scheme","lane":"tools","col":1,"type":"messagebus","label":"3. 准备可运行的预报方案","sublabel":"校验配置、模型、历史窗口和起报条件","tag":"A03–A04","width":190,"yOffset":40},{"id":"forecast","lane":"model","col":2,"type":"backend","label":"4. 运行水文模型","sublabel":"用历史条件和气象预报计算未来流量","tag":"A05 · Forecast","width":180},{"id":"check_output","lane":"tools","col":2,"type":"database","label":"5. 先检查预测结果是否正常","sublabel":"结果完整？时间对齐？数值和文件是否异常？","tag":"A05","width":198},{"id":"diagnose","lane":"agent","col":3,"type":"backend","label":"6. 分析问题可能出在哪里","sublabel":"数据 / 时间 / 历史状态 / 气象驱动 / 模型 / 暂不确定","tag":"A06 · 智能体判断","width":215},{"id":"repair","lane":"tools","col":4,"type":"messagebus","label":"修复数据或时间问题","sublabel":"有依据地补取、转换或纠正后重新运行","tag":"A02","width":178,"yOffset":-90},{"id":"rebuild","lane":"tools","col":4,"type":"messagebus","label":"重建历史起报条件","sublabel":"历史窗口、状态或缓存不一致时重新准备","tag":"A04","width":178,"yOffset":0},{"id":"adapt","lane":"model","col":4,"type":"backend","label":"有限参数优化","sublabel":"只有持续模型偏差且其他问题排除后才调用","tag":"A07 · Adapt","width":185,"yOffset":-10},{"id":"compare","lane":"tools","col":4,"type":"database","label":"7. 重新运行并比较结果","sublabel":"改善了吗？是否引入新退化？采用、撤销或继续诊断","tag":"A08–A09","width":205,"yOffset":90},{"id":"freeze","lane":"agent","col":4,"type":"security","label":"8. 冻结最终预报方案","sublabel":"无需干预或处理通过验证后，锁定模型、配置和规则","tag":"A10 · B 阶段结束","width":205,"yOffset":72},{"id":"replay","lane":"model","col":5,"type":"backend","label":"9. 用冻结方案连续起报","sublabel":"自动历史回放；此阶段不允许根据测试真值调参","tag":"A11 · F 阶段","width":205},{"id":"evaluate","lane":"tools","col":5,"type":"database","label":"10. 最后统一评价","sublabel":"读取测试真值，计算预报质量、完成率和人工工时","tag":"A12 · E 阶段","width":205,"yOffset":15},{"id":"report","lane":"user","col":5,"type":"frontend","label":"11. 输出结果与报告","sublabel":"预报结果 + 问题处理记录 + 评价指标 + 减负证据","tag":"最终交付","width":205}],"edges":[{"id":"task-check","from":"task","to":"check_data","label":"开始","variant":"default"},{"id":"check-prepare","from":"check_data","to":"prepare_scheme","label":"资料可用 / 已修复","variant":"emphasis"},{"id":"prepare-forecast","from":"prepare_scheme","to":"forecast","label":"方案可运行","variant":"emphasis"},{"id":"forecast-output","from":"forecast","to":"check_output","label":"预测结果","variant":"default"},{"id":"output-diagnose","from":"check_output","to":"diagnose","label":"发现异常或需进一步判断","variant":"emphasis"},{"id":"diagnose-freeze","from":"diagnose","to":"freeze","label":"正常 / 无充分干预依据","variant":"emphasis","role":"branch"},{"id":"diagnose-repair","from":"diagnose","to":"repair","label":"数据 / 时间问题","variant":"dashed","role":"branch"},{"id":"diagnose-rebuild","from":"diagnose","to":"rebuild","label":"历史状态问题","variant":"dashed","role":"branch"},{"id":"diagnose-adapt","from":"diagnose","to":"adapt","label":"持续模型偏差","variant":"dashed","role":"branch"},{"id":"repair-compare","from":"repair","to":"compare","variant":"default"},{"id":"rebuild-compare","from":"rebuild","to":"compare","variant":"default"},{"id":"adapt-compare","from":"adapt","to":"compare","variant":"default"},{"id":"compare-diagnose","from":"compare","to":"diagnose","label":"未解决 / 新证据","variant":"dashed","role":"return","route":"bottom-channel"},{"id":"compare-freeze","from":"compare","to":"freeze","label":"通过验证","variant":"emphasis","route":"return-left"},{"id":"freeze-replay","from":"freeze","to":"replay","label":"进入冻结回放","variant":"security"},{"id":"replay-evaluate","from":"replay","to":"evaluate","label":"全部冻结预测完成","variant":"emphasis","route":"up-channel"},{"id":"evaluate-report","from":"evaluate","to":"report","label":"评价完成","variant":"emphasis","route":"outside-right"}],"cards":[{"dot":"cyan","title":"先这样理解智能体","items":["智能体像“水文预报调度员”：它看证据、判断问题，再决定下一步调用哪个工具","数据检查、指标计算、模型运行和参数搜索仍由确定性程序执行"]},{"dot":"rose","title":"为什么不是每次都调参数？","items":["预测异常可能来自数据、时间、历史状态或气象驱动，不一定是模型参数问题","只有其他问题基本排除且偏差持续存在时，才进入有限参数优化","正确选择“保持当前方案”也是智能体成功完成任务的一种结果"]},{"dot":"violet","title":"A01–A12 怎么看","items":["编号只是与详细设计文档对应的内部动作编号，不要求小组成员先记住","看图时优先看每个框的大标题；需要深入实现时再用 A01–A12 回查动作契约"]}]}